### 1. Регистрация нового пользователя
POST http://localhost:8099/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Email": "rideruser@example.com",
  "Password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("userId", response.body.userId);
%}


### 2. Вход (Получение токена)
POST http://localhost:8099/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Email": "rideruser@example.com",
  "Password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.AccessToken);
%}


### 3. Создание вопроса (Токен подставляется автоматически)
POST http://localhost:8099/api/v1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "Title": "Testing via JetBrains Rider http client",
  "Body": "Is it possible to automate everything in .http files?"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("questionId", response.body.id);
%}


### 4. Лайк вопроса
POST http://localhost:8099/api/v1/questions/{{questionId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 5. Удаление пользователя (Saga)
DELETE http://localhost:8099/api/v1/auth/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}